{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は幕張メッセにて最後の走れbicycle！全国握手会ありました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約一万人の方々が来てくださっててビックリしました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージ裏から沢山の声援が聞こえてとってもほっこりしました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回はMC(司会)も勤めさせていただきましたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗\n大丈夫だったでしょうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても緊張したぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして若月ちゃまと二人だったんだけど\nとっても心強かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中スピーカーが落ちてきて、皆さんをビックリさせてしまってすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは大丈夫です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様の所に落ちなくて良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配して下さってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして抽選会の時お休みの柏ユッキーナの分もひかせていただきましたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調子にのって\n『柏餅みたいなもちもちほっぺのユッキーナこと柏ゆきなです』\nって言っちゃってすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユッキーナファンの方ほんとーにすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一緒のレーンは...じゃ〜ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本ななみん〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんと同じレーンだったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗で知的な素敵なお姉ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんとはよく同じレーンになるのさー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげでななみんファンの皆様とも仲良くさせてもらってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんファンの皆様もとってもいい人ばかりで心が暖かくなるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやと握手してくれて本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、まあや族さん達来てくれてありがとうございます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくて〜嬉しくて顔がニヤニヤしちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様にもニヤニヤや、ホッコリしてもらえたら、とっても嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これないけど応援してるよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってくれてた皆様...ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた顔がスマイルになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんはいつも優しいのよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね川後のひなぴょんが熱いお湯を足にこぼしちゃったのっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(涙)\nそしたら\n『すぐ水で洗って流してー』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言って冷たい水で流してあげてたのよっ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その間、深川マイマイと若月ゆみちゃんと西野ななせまるとまあやでこぼれたお湯を拭いたりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫っていってたけど心配......(涙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとに優しくて、母親的な愛情イッパイのお姉ちゃん達です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお世話になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして前回の写真の質問の答えは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←ピースしてる方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←背中向けてる方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生田ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の回答が多かったですねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか当たってる人はいませんでしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では次の問題"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんの腕を噛んでいる危険人物を発見したので撮ってみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてこの危険人物はだれでしょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは簡単かなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このみぎからでてる手はマイヤンですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイヤンに又カブドムシ攻撃しちゃうぞ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/15/8594878/0018.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}